join overworker left
overworker: Wait.. just gotta finish this..
leave overworker [animation="Instant Out"]
join main_player center
main_player: What are you working on?
leave main_player
join overworker left [animation="Instant In"]
overworker: Ha! What am I working on, you say!.. Well.. Uh.. Hard to explain really, you probably wouldn't get it anyway...
leave overworker [animation="Instant Out"]
join main_player center
main_player: C'mon, give me a chance
leave main_player
join overworker left
overworker: Alright.. But DONT touch anything!!
- Not my problem. Get back to work.
	do PlayerStats.add_apathy()
	overworker: Fine! See if I care...
- Are you okay? You seem really stressed.
	do PlayerStats.add_empathy()
	overworker: I... I guess I am. Thanks...
leave overworker
leave main_player
set {overworker.HasMetOverworker} = true